---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Mahindra Rivenza 3 BHK Flats | Deluxe & Ultra Luxury Mahalunge"
  description="Explore official 3 BHK residences at Mahindra Rivenza by Mahindra Lifespaces at Baner Annex, Mahalunge, Pune. 882 to 1,065 sq.ft. RERA carpet area, starting ₹1.31 Cr*. MahaRERA PR1261012602102 & PM1261012602103."
  keywords="mahindra rivenza 3 bhk, mahindra rivenza 3 bhk price, mahindra rivenza 3 bhk floor plan, mahindra rivenza 3 bhk carpet area, mahindra rivenza mahalunge 3 bhk, luxury 3 bhk flats in mahalunge pune, 3 bhk baner annex"
  canonical="https://mahindralifespaceshomes.in/residences/3-bhk/"
>
  <section class="pt-32 pb-20 bg-charcoal-950 border-b border-white/10 relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-6">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 px-3 py-1 rounded bg-gold-500/10 border border-gold-500/30 text-gold-400 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
        <span>Officially Launched Configuration</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-stone-100 max-w-4xl leading-tight">
        3 BHK Deluxe & Ultra Luxury: <br />
        <span class="gold-gradient-text">Spacious Family Living at Mahindra Rivenza</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-stone-300 text-sm sm:text-base max-w-2xl font-light leading-relaxed">
        Crafted across 3 typologies (Deluxe C, Deluxe B, and Ultra Luxury B) offering 882 to 1,065 sq.ft. RERA carpet area (995 to 1,206 sq.ft. aggregate) with starting prices from ₹1.31 Cr*.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Specs Grid -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-charcoal-900 border-b border-white/10">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6 text-center">
        <div class="p-4 bg-charcoal-950 rounded-xl border border-white/10">
          <div class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gold-400">882 - 1,065 sq.ft.</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-stone-400 uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">RERA Carpet Area Range</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 bg-charcoal-950 rounded-xl border border-white/10">
          <div class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-stone-100">995 - 1,206 sq.ft.</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-stone-400 uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">Aggregate Usable Area</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 bg-charcoal-950 rounded-xl border border-white/10">
          <div class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gold-400">From ₹1.31 Cr*</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-stone-400 uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">Launch Starting Price</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 bg-charcoal-950 rounded-xl border border-white/10">
          <div class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-emerald-400">Bookings Open</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-stone-400 uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">Phase 1 Priority Allotment</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Blueprint & Highlights -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-charcoal-950">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center">
      
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 bg-charcoal-900 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 p-6 shadow-2xl">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
          <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-gold-400 font-bold">Official Architectural Blueprint</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] text-emerald-400 bg-emerald-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-emerald-500/20 font-semibold">100% Vastu Compliant</span>
        </div>
        <div class="p-2 sm:p-4 bg-charcoal-950 rounded-xl border border-white/10 shadow-2xl overflow-hidden">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 700 480" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-full h-auto text-stone-300 font-sans select-none">
            <defs>
              <linearGradient id="b3-bg-page" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="100%">
                <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#0c1017"/>
                <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#141a26"/>
              </linearGradient>
              <pattern id="b3-grid-page" width="20" height="20" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
                <path d="M 20 0 L 0 0 0 20" fill="none" stroke="rgba(56,189,248,0.06)" stroke-width="0.75"/>
              </pattern>
            </defs>
            <rect width="700" height="480" rx="12" fill="url(#b3-bg-page)" stroke="#1e293b" stroke-width="2"/>
            <rect width="700" height="480" rx="12" fill="url(#b3-grid-page)"/>
            <polygon points="30,40 670,40 670,440 30,440" fill="#101520" stroke="#38bdf8" stroke-width="2.5" opacity="0.95"/>
            <g transform="translate(30, 40)">
              <rect width="100" height="80" fill="#161e2e" stroke="#38bdf8" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              <text x="50" y="40" fill="#e2e8f0" font-size="10" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle">ENTRANCE FOYER</text>
              <text x="50" y="55" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="8" text-anchor="middle">6'0" × 5'6"</text>
              <path d="M 30,80 A 30,30 0 0,0 60,50" fill="none" stroke="#d4af66" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="3,2"/>
            </g>
            <g transform="translate(130, 40)">
              <rect width="320" height="220" fill="#131924" stroke="#38bdf8" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              <text x="160" y="105" fill="#f8fafc" font-size="14" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle" letter-spacing="1">LIVING &amp; DINING SALON</text>
              <text x="160" y="125" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle">24'0" × 13'6"</text>
              <rect x="80" y="145" width="70" height="40" rx="4" fill="#1e293b" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="1"/>
              <text x="115" y="169" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="8" text-anchor="middle">DINING (6-Seater)</text>
              <rect x="180" y="145" width="110" height="50" rx="4" fill="#1e293b" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="1"/>
              <text x="235" y="174" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="8" text-anchor="middle">FORMAL LOUNGE</text>
            </g>
            <g transform="translate(450, 40)">
              <rect width="220" height="90" fill="#1a2538" stroke="#d4af66" stroke-width="2"/>
              <text x="110" y="45" fill="#f5d794" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle" letter-spacing="1">EBVT BALCONY DECK</text>
              <text x="110" y="65" fill="#cbd5e1" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle">14'0" × 6'0" • 113 Sq.Ft. Deck</text>
              <text x="110" y="80" fill="#38bdf8" font-size="8" text-anchor="middle">Panoramic Green &amp; River Vista</text>
            </g>
            <g transform="translate(30, 120)">
              <rect width="100" height="140" fill="#151b27" stroke="#38bdf8" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              <text x="50" y="165" fill="#f8fafc" font-size="10" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle">KITCHEN</text>
              <text x="50" y="180" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="8" text-anchor="middle">11'6" × 8'0"</text>
              <path d="M 10,130 L 90,130 L 90,160" fill="none" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="3"/>
              <rect x="10" y="210" width="80" height="40" fill="#1e293b" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="1"/>
              <text x="50" y="234" fill="#cbd5e1" font-size="7.5" text-anchor="middle">UTILITY / DRY</text>
            </g>
            <g transform="translate(450, 130)">
              <rect width="220" height="130" fill="#141a26" stroke="#38bdf8" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              <text x="110" y="185" fill="#f8fafc" font-size="11" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle">BEDROOM 03 / STUDY</text>
              <text x="110" y="202" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle">12'0" × 10'6"</text>
              <rect x="20" y="140" width="60" height="40" rx="3" fill="#1e293b" stroke="#64748b"/>
              <text x="50" y="164" fill="#64748b" font-size="8" text-anchor="middle">WORK DESK</text>
            </g>
            <g transform="translate(30, 260)">
              <rect width="280" height="180" fill="#141b28" stroke="#d4af66" stroke-width="2"/>
              <text x="140" y="310" fill="#f5d794" font-size="13" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle">MASTER BEDROOM SUITE</text>
              <text x="140" y="328" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle">15'0" × 12'0" (King Bed Placement)</text>
              <rect x="90" y="345" width="100" height="70" rx="4" fill="#1e293b" stroke="#d4af66" stroke-width="1"/>
              <text x="140" y="385" fill="#d4af66" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle">KING BED</text>
              <rect x="195" y="270" width="75" height="55" fill="#1b2333" stroke="#64748b"/>
              <text x="232" y="295" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="7.5" text-anchor="middle">WALK-IN CLOSET</text>
              <text x="232" y="310" fill="#64748b" font-size="7" text-anchor="middle">8'6" × 5'6"</text>
            </g>
            <g transform="translate(310, 260)">
              <rect width="200" height="180" fill="#131924" stroke="#38bdf8" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              <text x="100" y="310" fill="#f8fafc" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle">BEDROOM 02</text>
              <text x="100" y="328" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle">13'0" × 11'0"</text>
              <rect x="55" y="350" width="90" height="65" rx="3" fill="#1e293b" stroke="#64748b"/>
              <text x="100" y="387" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="8.5" text-anchor="middle">QUEEN BED</text>
            </g>
            <g transform="translate(510, 260)">
              <rect width="160" height="85" fill="#16202e" stroke="#38bdf8" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              <text x="80" y="298" fill="#e2e8f0" font-size="9" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle">MASTER BATH (4-Fixture)</text>
              <text x="80" y="315" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="8" text-anchor="middle">8'6" × 5'6" • Glass Partition</text>
              <rect y="90" width="160" height="90" fill="#16202e" stroke="#38bdf8" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              <text x="80" y="390" fill="#e2e8f0" font-size="9" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle">COMMON BATHROOM</text>
              <text x="80" y="407" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="8" text-anchor="middle">7'6" × 5'0"</text>
            </g>
            <g transform="translate(640, 70)">
              <circle cx="0" cy="0" r="16" fill="#111622" stroke="#d4af66" stroke-width="1.2"/>
              <polygon points="0,-12 3,0 0,-2 -3,0" fill="#d4af66"/>
              <polygon points="0,12 3,0 0,2 -3,0" fill="#64748b"/>
              <text x="0" y="-15" fill="#d4af66" font-size="8" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle">N</text>
            </g>
            <g transform="translate(40, 455)">
              <text x="0" y="14" fill="#d4af66" font-size="9" font-weight="bold">✦ RERA CARPET: 882 – 1,065 SQ.FT. (AGGREGATE USABLE: 995 – 1,206 SQ.FT.)</text>
              <text x="470" y="14" fill="#38bdf8" font-size="9">100% VASTU COMPLIANT EAST-FACING</text>
            </g>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-6">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-stone-100 font-bold">3 BHK Typologies Breakdown</h3>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 text-xs">
          <div class="p-3 bg-charcoal-950 rounded-lg border border-white/10">
            <div class="font-bold text-gold-400">3 BHK Deluxe C</div>
            <div class="text-stone-300 mt-1">882 sq.ft. RERA</div>
            <div class="text-[10px] text-stone-400">995 sq.ft. Aggregate</div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 bg-charcoal-950 rounded-lg border border-white/10">
            <div class="font-bold text-gold-400">3 BHK Deluxe B</div>
            <div class="text-stone-300 mt-1">894 sq.ft. RERA</div>
            <div class="text-[10px] text-stone-400">1,007 sq.ft. Aggregate</div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 bg-charcoal-950 rounded-lg border border-white/10">
            <div class="font-bold text-gold-400">3 BHK Ultra Luxury B</div>
            <div class="text-stone-300 mt-1">1,065 sq.ft. RERA</div>
            <div class="text-[10px] text-stone-400">1,206 sq.ft. Aggregate</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h4 class="font-serif text-lg text-stone-100 font-bold">Key Architectural Advantages</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs text-stone-300">
          <li class="flex items-start space-x-2">
            <span class="text-gold-400">✦</span>
            <span>24-foot wide living and banquet dining salon with deep balcony deck.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start space-x-2">
            <span class="text-gold-400">✦</span>
            <span>Master suite with dedicated walk-in wardrobe alcove and luxury en-suite bathroom.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start space-x-2">
            <span class="text-gold-400">✦</span>
            <span>Flexible third bedroom ideal as a hybrid work office, library, or children's study.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start space-x-2">
            <span class="text-gold-400">✦</span>
            <span>Double exposure overlooking ~44,000 sq.ft clubhouse and 9+ acres of central greens.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <div class="pt-2 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
          <button
            data-open-modal
            data-unit="3 BHK All Typologies"
            data-interest="3 BHK Cost Sheet Request"
            class="btn-shimmer flex-1 py-3 px-4 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-gold-400 to-gold-500 text-charcoal-950 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest hover:shadow-xl transition-all"
          >
            Get 3 BHK Cost Sheet
          </button>
          <button
            data-open-modal
            data-interest="3 BHK Floor Plan PDF"
            class="py-3 px-4 rounded-xl border border-white/20 hover:border-gold-400/60 bg-white/5 text-stone-200 hover:text-white text-xs uppercase tracking-wider transition-all"
          >
            Download 3 BHK Floor Plans PDF
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 13.46-Acre Master Layout Context -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-charcoal-900 border-t border-white/10">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-8">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto space-y-2">
        <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-gold-400 font-bold">Township Layout</span>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-stone-100 font-bold">3 BHK Towers Position in Master Layout</h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-300">
          Inspect how the 3 BHK luxury towers are nestled adjacent to the sunken aqua bar pool, central forest reserve, and athletic complex.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-charcoal-950 border border-white/10">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-xs text-stone-300">
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-charcoal-900 border border-white/5 space-y-1.5">
            <div class="font-bold text-gold-400 text-sm">Corner Positioned Floor Plates</div>
            <p>Most 3 BHK units occupy strategic corner wings ensuring 3-sided open ventilation, panoramic corner vistas, and elevated privacy from neighboring residences.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-charcoal-900 border border-white/5 space-y-1.5">
            <div class="font-bold text-gold-400 text-sm">Direct Pool & Clubhouse Views</div>
            <p>Balcony decks look directly onto the central water body, temperature-regulated pool with sunken aqua bar, and ~44,000 sq.ft lifestyle complex.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-charcoal-900 border border-white/5 space-y-1.5">
            <div class="font-bold text-gold-400 text-sm">G+30 to 37 Storey Elevations</div>
            <p>Elevated sky residences enjoy unobstructed vistas across the Baner-Mahalunge skyline, Mula river basin, and Sahyadri mountain ridgelines.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
